["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to Invest for A Hundred Years | Inigo Fraser Jenkins total portfolio approach rule against perpetuities recency bias 60-40\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-hiddenforces-股票和债券的风险其实一样大-只是没人告诉你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">52:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>股票和債券的風險其實一樣大，只是沒人告訴你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把持有期拉長到20年，股票和債券的波動率幾乎相等，債券出現實際虧損的概率反而更高——所以長期投資者真正該盯的不是市場基準，是購買力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span><span class=\"tag\">長期投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Democratic Socialism. Hope or Hopeless? DSA Rerum Novarum War on Poverty realignment left wing of the possible\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-throughline-美国-社会主义教父-的选择-向民主党内部妥协-而非揭竿另立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美國「社會主義教父」的選擇：向民主黨內部妥協，而非揭竿另立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harrington押注：與其在體制外另立社會主義政黨，不如擠進民主黨內部改造它——哪怕這意味著1968年要為支持越戰的候選人站臺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民主黨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Energy From Orbit: Can We Trust Power Beamed From Space? - Martin Soltau, Space Solar (EP 42) firm power rectenna power beaming intermittency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-theinbetweente-把发电站搬到太空-电价能降一个数量级吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b62c3494802d4ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>把發電站搬到太空，電價能降一個數量級嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太空太陽能不是科幻：同樣的光伏板在軌道上發電量是地面的 8 到 13 倍，真正的瓶頸不是物理，而是監管和公眾信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空太陽能</span><span class=\"tag\">能源轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"277.從提醒你，到替你辦：Today想把Personal AI帶到哪一步？ Personal Agent harness proactive KVCache rubrics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-luanfanshu-个人-agent-的胜负手不是模型-是记忆和主动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bbe378ca5d7d3313-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>個人 Agent 的勝負手不是模型，是記憶和主動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Today 團隊認為模型已接近 AGI、成本每年降十倍，瓶頸轉移到記憶與主動性；而主動做不好的產品，只會變成又一個騷擾推送。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">記憶系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Maya Hieroglyphs Decoded Classic Mayan uhul ahau Ahpitz\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-ancients-玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上-只给自己看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863dd630b8114639-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>瑪雅數學家的公式寫在王宮旁的牆上，只給自己看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010年危地馬拉舒爾頓意外發掘出一間小屋，牆上寫滿曆法計算公式並署名薩克坦瓦什——這不是刻給公眾看的紀念碑文，而是一位瑪雅數學家留給自己查閱的私人筆記。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">瑪雅</span><span class=\"tag\">古文字破譯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1M Users in 3 Months, Pivoted, Then Tripled User Count | James Clift, Durable GEO GMV South Park Commons vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-solofounders-ai-让开公司比找工作容易-但单人创始人没有退路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3187025de0dd83a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓開公司比找工作容易，但單人創始人沒有退路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Durable 三個月做到一百萬用戶，創始人卻說自己繞了彎路：網站生成不是終局，把服務業的全部後臺交給 AI 才是。單人創始人不是更自由，是把所有決定都壓在自己身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The &#x27;Scandalous&#x27; Life of Marie Antoinette Petit Hameau Salic law Estates General flight to Varennes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-historyhit-法国国王没有情妇-于是所有的恨都砸向王后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8da68a5c17656ef9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">53:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>法國國王沒有情婦，於是所有的恨都砸向王后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">君主是神選的，攻擊國王等於叛國，能罵的只有王后和情婦。路易十六偏偏不像歷代法王那樣有情婦，怨恨沒有分流口，全落在瑪麗·安托瓦內特一個人身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">王權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luca Ferrari, Bending Spoons CEO: The $40K Origin Story, Buying Product-Market Fit &amp; Why Private Equity Can&#x27;t Compete TLB (Term Loan B) unlevered returns\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-allin-私募股权学不会这套打法-团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/699f18b66a57c00f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>私募股權學不會這套打法：團隊和技術焊死後就沒法轉賣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人光環不是必需品：Bending Spoons靠統一技術底座和小團隊把收購來的產品跑到10分，這套打法PE學不來，因為PE要把公司分開養肥了賣，不敢把團隊和技術打通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">併購</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.276 做月嫂育兒嫂的姐姐，都有故事 chemistry 飛單 預約單和急單 兒童成長陪伴師\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-bizthisway-好阿姨永远在户上-家政顾问卖的不是信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>好阿姨永遠在戶上，家政顧問賣的不是信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家政是供給主導的行業，好阿姨不流入市場，顧問真正難的不是簽單而是售後換人；僱主和阿姨都是工資的搬運工。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家政</span><span class=\"tag\">月嫂育兒嫂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"E911.萬人工廠消失後，他的 200 萬張照片成了時代檔案 賣豬仔 自我民族誌 馬格蘭 Off-Pix\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-cn907a40-万人工厂消失后-他用-20-年拍下打工者的日常/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec61bd9ea105317f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">43:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>萬人工廠消失後，他用 20 年拍下打工者的日常</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別人拍時代的異常，他偏拍時代的日常——吃飯、打卡、學英語。等萬人大廠真的消失，只有極少數人留下了這套檔案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">製造業</span><span class=\"tag\">紀實攝影</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"VCs Would Bet on Open-Source AI Over OpenAI and Anthropic | E2341 Unreasonable Hospitality Dream Weaver table stakes minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-twist-把服务当成本中心的公司-正在把护城河让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d63a8348494027-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>把服務當成本中心的公司，正在把護城河讓出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">產品會被更好的產品取代，品牌會被更強的品牌取代，唯一長期存在的競爭優勢是待客之道——持續而慷慨地投資於關係。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"An Exclusive Interview With Ukraine’s President Zelensky PAC-2 PAC-3 Shahed drones\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-wsjournal-泽连斯基-中东战争正在抽走乌克兰的防空导弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>澤連斯基：中東戰爭正在抽走烏克蘭的防空導彈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國每月只造 60 到 65 枚導彈，中東開戰第一天就打掉 803 枚。澤連斯基說，普京要的就是一場長戰爭，因為資源耗盡對烏克蘭不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄烏戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">中東局勢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Who Is Wealthy in America, and How Did They Get Rich? pass-through business Survey of Consumer Finances C corporation TCJA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-mastersinbiz-美国最富的一群人-不是ceo而是开洗车店和暖通公司的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3553c0305688ae6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美國最富的一群人，不是CEO而是開洗車店和暖通公司的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國300萬私人企業主淨資產超500萬美元，合計財富是福布斯400富豪的十倍以上——他們開洗車店、暖通公司、汽車經銷店，靠的是擁有而不是掙工資。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Deep Learning Finally Cracked Messy Tables - Frank Hutter in-context learning posterior predictive distribution do-calculus structural causal model ELO score\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-mlst-深度学习靠合成数据训练-终于打赢了表格数据里的xgboost/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/166bfadd1a24fa05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>深度學習靠合成數據訓練，終於打贏了表格數據裡的XGBoost</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能找到的真實表格數據集只有約5萬個，不足以餵飽深度網絡；PriorLabs轉而用因果結構模型批量合成訓練數據，讓TabPFN第一次在表格預測上穩定超過XGBoost和CatBoost。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表格數據</span><span class=\"tag\">基礎模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬Bio-security is an AI Arms Race - Eric Nguyen (CEO, Radical Numerics) GLM (Genome Language Model) HyenaDNA Evo Omni biodefense sequence matching\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-latentspace-ai-能造出病毒了-防御方还停在序列比对/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6493311dc717df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能造出病毒了，防禦方還停在序列比對</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生成致病序列的模型和判別序列是否致病的模型本質上是同一批模型，所以做設計的團隊最適合做防禦——但防禦側現在遠遠落後，基線還停在序列比對。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">基因組模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Robert Moses and the Shaping of New York, Part 2 Title I slum clearance Power Broker King Features Syndicate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-stuffmissed-他修的路拆了谁的房-罗伯特-摩西的纽约遗产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>他修的路拆了誰的房：羅伯特·摩西的紐約遺產</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩西用聯邦 Title I 資金拆掉26個街區，把窮人從貧民窟趕到另一個貧民窟，卻宣稱98%的搬遷者住得更好——他的遺產至今無人能定論。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市更新</span><span class=\"tag\">基礎設施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Auto Research on Yukon with Soubhik Deb Q-day Johnson bound proximity gap NSD ping-pong MLX Dark Bloom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-zeroknowledge-google-藏起来的量子方案-被一群业余研究者反超了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>Google 藏起來的量子方案，被一群業餘研究者反超了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 用零知識證明證明自己找到了更省資源的量子破解方案，卻不公開電路。Yukon 把這個問題變成開放競賽，讓 agent 在別人的提交上繼續跑，最終反超 Google 結果 60% 以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動研究</span><span class=\"tag\">零知識證明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Lyse Doucet Has Learned from 40 Years Reporting From War Zones, Live war of choice chadili agency madrasa\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-iq2-信息从未如此充裕-我们却选择不知道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30946a55a23131db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>信息從未如此充裕，我們卻選擇不知道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lyse Doucet 做了四十年戰地報道，她的判斷是：不知道不是因為信息不夠，而是因為不想知道。而這場伊朗戰爭是一場選擇之戰，它讓一切變得更糟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">戰地報道</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shashank Joshi on Why Russia Won&#x27;t Invade NATO—Yet Article V hybrid warfare Bab-el-Mandeb East-West pipeline\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-goodfight-俄罗斯不会入侵北约-但正在测试它会不会散架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯不會入侵北約，但正在測試它會不會散架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄羅斯沒有能力發動地面進攻，它的真正目標是腐蝕北約的政治凝聚力——用無人機、包裹炸彈和模糊地帶，逼美國在危機中暴露分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">北約</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Amjad Masad on Rethinking College for the AI Era premature optimization Holacracy self-driving company vibe research virtue ethics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-a16z-年轻人对社会的用处是当异端-不是当好公民/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>年輕人對社會的用處是當異端，不是當好公民</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大學把年輕人訓練成好公民，但社會真正需要的是他們質疑所有人習以為常的東西；AI 時代每個學生都能自己動手做項目，缺的只是被允許。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">創業時機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Thinks A.I. Alarmism Has Gone Too Far inference time scaling retrieval based computing containment agent harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-ezra-黄仁勋-说-ai-有-10-概率毁灭人类是不负责任的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：說 AI 有 10% 概率毀滅人類是不負責任的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他承認 AI 會改變每一份工作，但把失控風險當成可解的工程問題：如果實驗室真相信自己失控了，正確答案就是別發布產品，而不是一邊買最多算力一邊請求被減速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Has the UK’s productivity puzzle been solved? ONS productivity puzzle leaving certificate loudness wars\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-moreorless-英国生产率危机是统计错误-0-7-被改成-1-3/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>英國生產率危機是統計錯誤：0.7% 被改成 1.3%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國被當成發達國家生產率最差生的十五年，可能只是 ONS 算錯了工時——把度假的人按 40 小時算進去，分母虛高，生產率被壓低。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">生產率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why are used cars priced like new cars? price waterfall APR MSRP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-indicator-二手车为什么卖出了新车的价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>二手車為什麼賣出了新車的價格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新車漲價會通過「價格瀑布」把二手車一起拖上去，疫情減產讓車市像蛇吞老鼠一樣消化了好幾年，而美國車企乾脆停產了便宜轎車——10 到 15 千美元能買到的車，車齡從 5 年變成了 9 年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車市場</span><span class=\"tag\">通脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Is our national debt finally too much? (update) deficit hawk / deficit dove crowding out debt to GDP ratio Treasury bonds\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-planetmoney-美国债务破-40-万亿-连鸽派都改口当鹰派了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美國債務破 40 萬億：連鴿派都改口當鷹派了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010 年那篇說債務超 GDP 90% 增長就減半的論文，被政客當成紅線用了十幾年；如今連當年主張大膽花錢的鴿派經濟學家都改口自稱鷹派，但沒人能說出那條線在哪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">美國國債</span>\n</div></div></a>"]